 "良好": "حَسَن, جَيِّد (Of a person or an animal:) / حَسَن, جَيِّد (Of a capability:) / صِحِّيّ (Of a property or quality:) / حَسَنًا (That is good; an elliptical exclamation of satisfaction or commendation.) / خَيْر (The forces or behaviours that are the enemy of evil. Usually consists of helping) / سِلْعَة (An item of merchandise.)  [good]\nمثال: それに比べ最近彼女のお天気は良好。\n→ In comparison to which she's been in a really good mood recently.",
