 "苦い": "مُرّ (Having an acrid taste (usually from a basic substance).) / أَلِيم (Harsh, piercing, acerbic or stinging.) / مَقِيت, مَمْقُوت (Hateful or hostile.)  [bitter (taste)]\nمثال: 私は苦いものが好きだ。\n→ I have a fancy for bitter things. / حَامِض (Excessively acidic and thus infertile. (of soil))  [sour (expression, look)] / مُرّ (Having an acrid taste (usually from a basic substance).) / أَلِيم (Harsh, piercing, acerbic or stinging.) / مَقِيت, مَمْقُوت (Hateful or hostile.)  [bitter (e.g. experience)]\nمثال: 彼は苦い経験を味わった。\n→ He had a bitter experience.",
