 "行けません": "مُخْطِئ (Asserting something incorrect or untrue.) / ظَلَمَ (To treat unjustly; to injure or harm; to do wrong by.)  [wrong] / [hopeless ; past hope] / [must not do] / [cannot go]",
 "行ずる": "أَدَّى (To do (something); to execute.)  [to perform]\nمثال: 忍を行じてのみ、よく怨みを解くことを得る。\n→ By love alone is enmity allayed.",
 "行ったりきたり": "ذَهَابًا وَإِيَابًا (From one place to another and back again.)  [back and forth]\nمثال: マウスとキーボードを行ったりきたりするのが煩雑なので、キーボードのみで操作できるようショートカットキーはないのでしょうか？\n→ It's a fiddle going to and fro between the keyboard and mouse so are there shortcuts to allow operation using only the keyboard?",
 "行ったり来たり": "ذَهَابًا وَإِيَابًا (From one place to another and back again.)  [back and forth]\nمثال: マウスとキーボードを行ったりきたりするのが煩雑なので、キーボードのみで操作できるようショートカットキーはないのでしょうか？\n→ It's a fiddle going to and fro between the keyboard and mouse so are there shortcuts to allow operation using only the keyboard?",
 "行ったり来り": "ذَهَابًا وَإِيَابًا (From one place to another and back again.)  [back and forth]\nمثال: マウスとキーボードを行ったりきたりするのが煩雑なので、キーボードのみで操作できるようショートカットキーはないのでしょうか？\n→ It's a fiddle going to and fro between the keyboard and mouse so are there shortcuts to allow operation using only the keyboard?",
 "行っちまえ": "اِبْتَعَدَ (To depart or leave a place.)  [go away]",
 "行ってき": "إِلَى اللِّقَاء (short for goodbye — see also goodbye) / مَعَ السَّلَامَة (short for goodbye — see also goodbye) / سَلَام (short for goodbye — see also goodbye)  [bye]",
 "行ってきます": "إِلَى اللِّقَاء, أَرَاكَ لَاحِقًا (A phrase used at parting, and not necessarily implying that the person being add)  [see you later]\noften has a response of いってらっしゃい\nمثال: 一時間したら行ってきます。\n→ I'm going out in an hour.",
 "行ってくる": "إِلَى اللِّقَاء, أَرَاكَ لَاحِقًا (A phrase used at parting, and not necessarily implying that the person being add)  [see you later] / ذَهَبَ, رَاحَ (To move, either physically or in an abstract sense:) / ذَهَبَ, زَالَ (To pass, to be used up:) / غُو (A strategic board game, originally from China and today also popular in Japan an)  [to go (and then come back)]\nمثال: ちょっと郵便局へいってくる。\n→ I'm just going to drop by the post office.",
