 "表": "سَطْح (The overside or upside of a flat object such as a table, or of a liquid.) / سَطْح (The locus of an equation (especially one with exactly two degrees of freedom) in) / طفا إلى السطح (To rise to the surface.) / طفا إلى السطح (To become known or apparent; to appear or be found; to come to light.)  [surface] / وَجْه, مُحَيًّا (The front part of the head of a human or other animal, featuring the eyes, nose,) / مَظْهَر (Public image; outward appearance.) / وَاجَهَ (To deal with (a difficult situation or person); to accept (facts, reality, etc.))  [face (i.e. the visible side of an object)]\nمثال: この紙はどちらが表だか見分けがつかない。\n→ I cannot tell which is the right side of this paper. / جَبْهَة (An area where armies are engaged in conflict, especially the line of contact.) / أَمَامِيّ (Located at or near the front.)  [front (of a building, etc.)]\nمثال: 私はその問題がわかっていない。裏と表の区別もついていない。\n→ I don't understand the problem; I could make neither head nor tail of it. / خَارِج, بره (The part of something that faces out; the outer surface.) / خَارِج (Outdoors.) / خَارِج (On the outside of, not inside (something, such as a building).)  [outside]\nمثال: 一体何が今晩表であんなひどい音をたてているのか見当もつきません。\n→ I don't know what kind of creature is making such a terrible noise outside tonight.",
 "表す": "مَثَّلَ (To stand or act in the place of; to perform the duties, exercise the rights, or )  [to represent]\nesp. 表す, 表わす\nمثال: ＆のマークはａｎｄの文字を表す。\n→ The sign \"&\" stands for \"and\". / كَشَفَ (To uncover; to show and display that which was hidden or unknown.) / أَوْحَى, أَنْزَلَ (To communicate that which could not be known or discovered without divine or sup)  [to reveal]\nesp. 現す, 現わす\nمثال: ご自分の栄光を現された。\n→ He thus revealed his glory. / عَبَّرَ (To convey or communicate; to make known or explicit.)  [to express]\nesp. 表す, 表わす\nمثال: あなたのご親切に対し深く感謝の意を表します。\n→ I wish to express my deep appreciation for your kindness. / [to make widely known]\nesp. 顕す",
