 "見咎める": "سُؤَال, سؤال (A worded or expressed sentence, phrase, or only a word on its own, which asks fo) / مَسْأَلَة (A subject or topic for consideration or investigation.) / استفهم (To ask questions of; to interrogate; to ask for information.)  [to question]",
 "見回す": "تَلَفَّتَ (To inspect a building or area.)  [to look around]\nمثال: ポストを探して辺りを見回した。\n→ I looked about for the mailbox.",
