 "見回る": "دَوْرِيَّة, خَفْر (A going of the rounds along the chain of sentinels and between the posts, by a g) / دَوْرِيَّة, خَفْر (A movement, by a small body of troops beyond the line of outposts, to explore th) / دَوْرِيَّة (The guards who go the rounds for observation; a detachment whose duty it is to p)  [to patrol]\nمثال: 警備員たちは１時間ごとに輪番で見回った。\n→ The guards rotated in making their rounds every hour.",
