 "見張り": "سَاعَة (A portable or wearable timepiece.) / حَارِس (A person or group of people who guard.) / رَصَدَ (To observe over a period of time; to notice or pay attention.) / حَذِرَ (To be wary or cautious of.) / حَرَسَ (To attend to dangers to or regarding.)  [watch]\nمثال: ２人の兵士が、門のところで見張りをしていた。\n→ Two soldiers kept guard at the gate.",
