 "見当": "خَمَّنَ, حزر (To reach a partly (or totally) unconfirmed conclusion; to engage in conjecture; )  [guess]\nمثال: それがどこにあるのか、およその見当はついている。\n→ I have a rough idea where it is. / اِتِّجَاه (A theoretical line (physically or mentally) followed from a point of origin or t) / إِخْرَاج (The work of the director in cinema or theater; the skill of directing a film, pl)  [direction] / [registration mark (printing)] / حَوَالَيْ, تَقْرِيبًا (Imprecise but close to in quantity or amount.)  [approximately]",
 "見当ちがい": "مُخْطِئ (Asserting something incorrect or untrue.) / ظَلَمَ (To treat unjustly; to injure or harm; to do wrong by.)  [wrong (guess or estimate)]",
