 "見所": "[point worthy of note ; good point] / وَعْد, وَعْدَة (An oath or affirmation; a vow.) / وَعَدَ, تَعَهَّدَ (To commit to (some action or outcome), or to assure (a person) of such commitmen) / بَشَّرَ (To give grounds for expectation, especially of something good.)  [(signs of) promise]",
 "見抜く": "أَدْرَكَ, وَعَى (To become aware of, through the physical senses, to see; to understand.)  [to perceive]\nمثال: 私は彼らの陰謀をすぐに見抜いた。\n→ I saw through their plot at once.",
 "見捨てる": "اِنْصَرَفَ, يَنْصَرِفُ (To give up or relinquish control of, to surrender or to give oneself over, or to) / تَرَكَ, يترك (To leave behind; to desert, as in a ship, a position, or a person, typically in )  [to abandon]\nمثال: 彼は友人から見捨てられてしまった。\n→ He was deserted by his friends.",
 "見掛ける": "لَاحَظَ (To remark upon; to mention.) / لَاحَظَ, اِنْتَبَهَ (To become aware of; to observe.)  [to notice]\nمثال: 私は安室奈美恵を見かけた。\n→ I caught sight of Namie Amuro.",
