 "見易い": "[easy to see ; easy to read]\nمثال: あそこなら花火が見やすいよ。\n→ It's easy to see the fireworks from over there. / [easy to understand] / جَذَّاب (Causing attraction; having the quality of attracting by inherent force.) / جَذَّاب (Having the power of charming or alluring by agreeable qualities; enticing.)  [attractive]",
 "見晴す": "صَفَحَ (To pretend not to have noticed (something, especially a mistake or flaw); to pas)  [to overlook]\nمثال: タワーからは眼下に平野が見晴らせる。\n→ From the tower you can look out across the plain spread beneath your eyes.",
