 "見物人": "مُشَاهِد, رَاءٍ (One who observes, sees, or views something; an observer.)  [spectator]\nمثال: 彼が飛行機に乗り込むと、見物人が集まってきた。\n→ Spectators gathered as he climbed into the plane.",
