 "見積もり書": "اِقْتِبَاس, اِسْتِشْهَاد (A statement attributed to a person; a quotation.) / عَلَامَة اِقْتِبَاس, عَلَامَة تَنْصِيص (A quotation mark.) / سَعَر (A summary of work to be done with a set price; a quotation.) / سِعْرُ ٱلْأَسْهُم (A price set and offered (by the potential seller) for a financial security or co) / اِسْتَشْهَدَ, اِقْتَبَسَ (To indicate verbally or by equivalent means the start of a quotation.)  [quote]\nمثال: できるだけ早くお見積書をいただけますようにお願いします。\n→ We are looking forward to receiving your quote as soon as possible.",
