 "言伝える": "[to hand down (a story, legend, etc.) ; to pass on (to the next generation)]\nمثال: この湖についての不思議な伝説が言い伝えられている。\n→ A mysterious legend has been handed down about this lake. / نَشَرَ (To disperse, to scatter or distribute over a given area.) / نَشَرَ (To disseminate; to cause to proliferate, to make (something) widely known or pre) / اِنْتِشَار (The act of spreading.)  [to spread (a rumor, news, etc.)] / [to send word ; to pass on (a message)]",
