 "言掛ける": "[to start to say ; to attempt to say]\nمثال: 彼が何か言いかけたが先手を打ってやった。\n→ He started to say something, but I beat him to it. / خُطْبَة, نِدَاء (Direction.) / عُنْوَان, عِنْوَان (Direction.) / عَنْوَنَ (To direct in writing, as a letter; to superscribe, or to direct and transmit.)  [to address]",
