 "言止す": "وَقَفَ, تَوَقَّفَ (To cease moving.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to cease moving or progressing.) / تَوَقَّفَ, وَقَّف (To cease; to no longer continue.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to come to an end.) / مَوْقِف (A (usually marked) place where buses, trams or trains halt to let passengers get) / وَقْفَة (An action of stopping; interruption of travel.)  [to stop (saying)]",
 "言添える": "جَمَعَ (To sum up; to put together mentally; to add up.) / أَضَافَ (To append (e.g. a statement); to say further information.) / أَضَافَ (To intensify; to augment; to increase.) / أَضَافَ (To add someone as a friend.)  [to add (to what was said before)]",
