 "言草": "تَعْلِيق, مَلْحُوظَة (A spoken or written remark.) / عَلَّقَ (To remark.)  [comments] / [way of talking ; speaking style] / عَذَرَ (To forgive; to pardon; to overlook.) / اِعْتَذَرَ (To allow to leave, or release from any obligation.) / عُذْر (An explanation designed to avoid or alleviate guilt or negative judgment; a plea)  [excuse] / مَوْضُوع, مَوَاضِيع (A subject; a theme; a category or general area of interest.)  [topic (of conversation)]",
 "言葉": "لُغَة, لِسَان (A body of words, and set of methods of combining them (called a grammar), unders) / لُغَة (A sublanguage: the slang of a particular community or jargon of a particular spe) / لُغَة (A computer language; a machine language.)  [language]\nمثال: 「言葉の一面は、伝達しようとする意志である」と彼は言う。\n→ \"One aspect of language is an intent to communicate,\" he says. / كَلِمَة, كَلَام (Something that someone said; a comment, utterance; speech.) / كَلِمَةُ اللهِ (Communication from God; the message of the Christian gospel; the Bible, Scriptur)  [word]\nمثال: 言葉が出てこなかった。\n→ Words failed me. / حَدِيث, خُطْبَة (A formal session of speaking, especially a long oral message given publicly by o)  [speech]\nمثال: 乱暴な言葉を使ってはいけない。\n→ Don't be rough in speech. / كَلِمَة, كَلَام (Something that someone said; a comment, utterance; speech.) / كَلِمَةُ اللهِ (Communication from God; the message of the Christian gospel; the Bible, Scriptur)  [words]",
 "言葉つき": "حَدِيث, خُطْبَة (A formal session of speaking, especially a long oral message given publicly by o)  [speech]",
 "言葉どおり": "حَرْفًا بِحَرْفٍ, حَرْفِيًّا (Word for word; in exactly the same words as were used originally.)  [verbatim]\nمثال: 虚心坦懐に申し上げる。今から言うことは、言葉どおりに受け取ってほしい。\n→ I'm going to speak to you with utmost candor so I want you to take everything I'm about to say at face value.",
