 "言葉を吐く": "تَكَلَّمَ, تَحَدَّثَ (To communicate, usually by means of speech.) / مُحَاضَرَة (A lecture.) / خِطَاب (A major topic of social discussion.) / مُحَادَثَات, مُفَاوَضَات (Meeting to discuss a particular matter.)  [to talk]",
