 "言葉を残す": "قَالَ, قال (To pronounce.) / يَتْلُو (To recite.) / قَالَ, قَالَ (To tell, either verbally or in writing.)  [to say (for posterity)]\nمثال: 彼は生徒にこの有名な言葉を残した。\n→ He left his students these famous words. / [to leave some things unsaid]",
